{"id":"tegami-mqtwuqf4","createdAt":"2026-06-25T19:44:11.584Z","version":"0.0.0","changelogs":{"text-underline-offset.md":{"filename":"text-underline-offset.md","content":"---\npackages:\n  cargo:takumi-css:\n    type: patch\n  cargo:takumi-core:\n    type: patch\n---\n\n### Support `text-underline-offset`\n\nAdd the `text-underline-offset` property, accepting `auto` or a `<length-percentage>` that shifts the underline away from the text. Percentages resolve against `1em`. Applies to the raster and SVG backends.\n"},"font-variant.md":{"filename":"font-variant.md","content":"---\npackages:\n  cargo:takumi-css:\n    type: patch\n  cargo:takumi-core:\n    type: patch\n---\n\n### Support `font-variant` properties\n\nAdd `font-variant` and its `font-variant-ligatures`, `font-variant-numeric`, `font-variant-east-asian`, `font-variant-caps`, and `font-variant-position` longhands. Each maps to OpenType features and resolves before `font-feature-settings`, which still wins on a tag conflict. `font-variant-alternates` and `font-variant-emoji` are out of scope, and missing features are not synthesized.\n"},"offset-path-dpr.md":{"filename":"offset-path-dpr.md","content":"---\npackages:\n  cargo:takumi-css:\n    type: patch\n  cargo:takumi-raster:\n    type: patch\n  cargo:takumi-svg:\n    type: patch\n---\n\n### Fix `path()` ignoring device-pixel-ratio\n\n`offset-path: path()` and `clip-path: path()` used the authored SVG coordinates verbatim while every other basic shape crossed the dpr boundary through `to_px`. At `devicePixelRatio != 1` the path was mis-scaled by `1/dpr`. The coordinates are now scaled into device space like the other shapes.\n"},"background-origin.md":{"filename":"background-origin.md","content":"---\npackages:\n  cargo:takumi-css:\n    type: minor\n  cargo:takumi-core:\n    type: minor\n---\n\n### Support `background-origin`\n\nAdd the `background-origin` property (`border-box`, `padding-box`, `content-box`), which sets the area that `background-position` and `background-size` resolve against. The `background` shorthand reads `<box>` values: the first sets origin and clip, a second overrides clip.\n\nThe initial value is `padding-box`, matching CSS, so backgrounds on bordered boxes now position against the padding box instead of the border box.\n"}},"packages":{"npm:@takumi-rs/image-response":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:takumi-js":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/helpers":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/wasm":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/core":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-css":{"type":"minor","changelogIds":["text-underline-offset.md","font-variant.md","offset-path-dpr.md","background-origin.md"],"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs"],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","update dependency \"takumi-core\"","sync \"takumi\" group package versions","update dependency \"takumi-raster\"","update dependency \"takumi-svg\""],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-raster":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["offset-path-dpr.md"],"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","update dependency \"takumi-core\""],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-svg":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["offset-path-dpr.md"],"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","update dependency \"takumi-core\""],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-core":{"ty